            "value": "<p>You gain one champion feat. For the purpose of meeting its prerequisites, your champion level is equal to half your character level.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat more than once. Each time you select it, you gain another champion feat.</p>"
